/* Rapid Medical — project pack for the wireframes kit (/wireframes). Generated by make-pack.py; do not edit pack.js.
   Everything of the site here is drawn by the site itself (snapshot rm-render.json, blocks-kit/render.sh), in grey
   wireframe tokens (DESIGN.md → «Вайрфреймы»):
   - "rm-<type>": a page block, the variant in "v" and the block's own fields (same names as in code);
   - "rm-page": blocks grouped the way the site does (BlockList); notes and hotspots work on each item;
   - "rm-header" {region, menuOpen}, "rm-footer" {region}, "rm-regionBanner" {suggested}: the site's header, footer, banner;
   - "rm-regionModal" {region, source, back | next}: the «Choose your location» window (as a screen's overlay);
   - "rm-route" {path}: the main part of a real page of the site, for pages built in their route (publication, news,
     study, event) — the page between the header and the footer.
   On any of them:
   - "act": [steps] — done in the browser before the snapshot, for a state (render.cjs → act): {click}, {fill: [label,
     value]}, {select}, {check}, {honeypot: true}, {expect: text}, {wait};
   - "links": [{text, to, label, quiet}] — hotspots on the real links and buttons with that text;
   - "state": {"hover": text} — the element with that text (its group) shown hovered: menus, cards;
   - "focus": {"part": "<field>", "style": "selected"|"hover", "toolbar": [nodes], "cursor": true} — the part is found by
     the field's text (header: menu | switcher | contact).
   A node with no snapshot shows a warning: re-run render.sh after changing a flow. "asis": true (screens "as is")
   takes the snapshot of the code before the redesign (rm-render-asis.json); "branch": "<name>" — of that branch, not
   yet in main (rm-render-branch-<name>.json, render-branch.sh <name>).
   @components rm-page rm-header rm-footer rm-regionBanner rm-regionModal rm-route rm-dialog rm-hot rm-hero rm-text rm-richText rm-textMedia rm-media rm-keyNumbers rm-passport rm-columns rm-video rm-cta rm-productDetails rm-deviceDiagram rm-specTable rm-gallery rm-people rm-news rm-events rm-publications rm-webinars rm-jobs rm-form rm-officesMap rm-regionChooser rm-indications */
